1
00:00:00,130 --> 00:00:03,100
We’re introducing new updates
to the YouTube Partner Program.

2
00:00:03,166 --> 00:00:05,302
If you’re a creator
currently in the Program

3
00:00:05,369 --> 00:00:10,674
you’ll need to review and accept new
terms by January 31, 2027 to keep earning.

4
00:00:10,807 --> 00:00:13,176
If you’re a creator looking
to apply to the Program

5
00:00:13,243 --> 00:00:15,879
there are new eligibility
requirements you need to know.

6
00:00:15,946 --> 00:00:20,217
There are also changes to the way
the Shorts creator pool is being distributed

7
00:00:20,284 --> 00:00:23,487
and we're introducing new
revenue streams like Premium Lite

8
00:00:23,554 --> 00:00:25,722
and targeted incentive programs.

9
00:00:25,822 --> 00:00:29,660
With these changes, our total investment
in creators remains unchanged.

10
00:00:29,726 --> 00:00:33,897
In fact, we expect to pay even more
to creators in 2027 than we did

11
00:00:33,964 --> 00:00:36,667
in 2026. Let’s walk through what’s changing.

12
00:00:36,733 --> 00:00:41,772
First, we’re updating the YouTube Partner
Program entry requirements to unlock ads

13
00:00:41,838 --> 00:00:44,107
and Premium revenue sharing for new creators.

14
00:00:44,174 --> 00:00:46,810
While YouTube has grown
to billions of monthly viewers

15
00:00:46,877 --> 00:00:50,514
the YPP entry thresholds
have remained mostly unchanged.

16
00:00:50,581 --> 00:00:52,215
To reflect the growth of YouTube

17
00:00:52,282 --> 00:00:54,484
starting February 1, 2027

18
00:00:54,551 --> 00:00:58,088
entry thresholds for new
creators are 1000 subscribers

19
00:00:58,155 --> 00:01:02,459
and either 8000 qualified
watch hours in the last 12 months

20
00:01:02,526 --> 00:01:06,763
or 20 million qualified
Shorts views in the last 90 days.

21
00:01:06,897 --> 00:01:11,268
If you’re already in YPP,
your status is not impacted by this update.

22
00:01:11,468 --> 00:01:15,005
There are no changes to the eligibility
requirements for fan funding

23
00:01:15,072 --> 00:01:17,841
YouTube creator partnerships
or YouTube shopping.

24
00:01:17,908 --> 00:01:21,345
These products will continue to help
creators start their earning journeys

25
00:01:21,411 --> 00:01:25,983
when they reach 500 subscribers,
3000 qualified watch hours in the last year

26
00:01:26,049 --> 00:01:29,386
or 3 million qualified
Shorts views in the last 90 days.

27
00:01:29,686 --> 00:01:33,523
Next, to earn ads and
Premium revenue share for Shorts each month

28
00:01:33,590 --> 00:01:38,829
creators will now need to maintain 10
million Shorts views over the last 90 days.

29
00:01:38,929 --> 00:01:41,865
If your business is already
seeing similar Shorts views

30
00:01:41,932 --> 00:01:44,768
this change is unlikely
to impact your earnings.

31
00:01:44,901 --> 00:01:49,272
Importantly, this update will not
impact your overall YPP status

32
00:01:49,339 --> 00:01:53,810
nor will it impact other YPP
revenue streams like long-form video ads.

33
00:01:54,044 --> 00:01:56,813
While you'll need to meet
minimum thresholds to earn ads

34
00:01:56,880 --> 00:01:58,782
and Premium revenue share for Shorts

35
00:01:58,849 --> 00:02:03,587
we're also adding new targeted incentive
programs to ensure creators have more ways

36
00:02:03,654 --> 00:02:06,189
to earn, especially those just starting out.

37
00:02:06,256 --> 00:02:09,826
These programs will include things
like bonuses for YouTube shopping

38
00:02:09,893 --> 00:02:14,231
incentives for brand deals and earnings
boosts for cultural trend activations.

39
00:02:14,297 --> 00:02:18,135
They’re designed to reward you based on
things like growth and engagement rates

40
00:02:18,201 --> 00:02:19,569
not just your total views.

41
00:02:19,636 --> 00:02:22,873
We'll share specific
criteria and how to opt in soon.

42
00:02:23,073 --> 00:02:27,044
Plus, we’re expanding Premium Lite
to all countries where Premium is available.

43
00:02:27,177 --> 00:02:31,581
Premium Lite offers ad-free offline
and background viewing outside of music

44
00:02:31,648 --> 00:02:33,617
and Shorts. For creators

45
00:02:33,684 --> 00:02:37,921
this means a more leaned-in viewer
audience that can actively contribute

46
00:02:37,988 --> 00:02:39,289
to subscription earnings.

47
00:02:39,356 --> 00:02:41,825
When a user signs up for Premium, on average

48
00:02:41,892 --> 00:02:44,661
partners earn more than when
the user was watching ads.

49
00:02:44,728 --> 00:02:48,999
We’re also updating our terms to
support new Shorts ad formats.

50
00:02:49,066 --> 00:02:53,036
In the future, iIf a brand targets an
ad to five or fewer specific channels

51
00:02:53,103 --> 00:02:56,039
you'll be able to earn direct
revenue from those placements

52
00:02:56,106 --> 00:02:58,742
on top of the existing Shorts creator pool.

53
00:02:58,809 --> 00:03:01,578
If you’re a creator in the YouTube
Partner program currently

54
00:03:01,645 --> 00:03:06,283
you’ll need to review and accept
these new terms by January 31, 2027

55
00:03:06,349 --> 00:03:10,487
to keep earning. You may see terms
around watch page monetization

56
00:03:10,587 --> 00:03:13,557
Shorts monetization, and
fan funding monetization.

57
00:03:13,623 --> 00:03:17,394
For creators who enabled fan
funding features like channel memberships

58
00:03:17,461 --> 00:03:22,332
or Super Chat before 2023, you may
still be on an older version of the terms.

59
00:03:22,399 --> 00:03:24,134
To keep our legal terms consistent

60
00:03:24,201 --> 00:03:27,304
we’re moving everyone to the current
Commerce Product module.

61
00:03:27,370 --> 00:03:29,706
There are no changes
to eligibility thresholds

62
00:03:29,773 --> 00:03:32,642
how the products work or revenue share rates.

63
00:03:32,709 --> 00:03:36,546
Now let's walk through how to accept the new
YouTube Partner Program terms.

64
00:03:36,613 --> 00:03:37,848
Head to YouTube studio

65
00:03:37,914 --> 00:03:42,319
on desktop or mobile. You’ll see a
notification in your studio dashboard.

66
00:03:42,385 --> 00:03:44,554
Choose Review updated terms.

67
00:03:44,621 --> 00:03:48,391
From there, select Continue,
read each module and if you accept

68
00:03:48,458 --> 00:03:50,861
check the box and hit Accept and continue.

69
00:03:51,027 --> 00:03:53,630
Once you’ve finished
accepting them all, hit Finish.

70
00:03:53,697 --> 00:03:59,336
Remember, you must accept these module
updates by January 31, 2027 to keep earning

71
00:03:59,402 --> 00:04:03,206
we encourage you to accept all of them
to reach your full earning potential.

72
00:04:03,273 --> 00:04:06,710
For more info, check out the links
in the description. Thanks for watching.

